      ],
      "comment": "Dottore: Zandik at the Akademiya",
      "content": "Zandik joined the Sumeru Akademiya young. He disliked being tied to a Darshan, distrusted its dependence on the Akasha, and resented its reluctance to study the Great Red Sand. In desert ruins he refused the god Thoth's offer of power with undisclosed costs. At Gurabad he found incomplete Khaenri'ahn machines, and as a trainee Dastur at Ardravi Valley he found the missing parts inside a Ruin Golem, along with Schwanenritter records.",
