      "key": [
        "Pierro",
        "Great Red Sand",
        "Wise Doctor's Pinion",
        "Pale Flame"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Dottore",
        "Zandik",
        "recruited"
      ],
      "comment": "Dottore: Recruitment by Pierro",
      "content": "Pierro, 'the first of the Fatui', tracked the expelled Zandik into the desert. Zandik offered to manufacture something they would call a god if given resources and time, and asked whether Pierro would treat him as the Akademiya had, or as his hometown had with pitchforks. Pierro offered the title 'Il Dottore'; Zandik laughed at the irony.",
