      "key": [
        "Pantalone",
        "Regrator",
        "Feofan",
        "Northland Bank",
        "immortality elixir"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Dottore",
        "Zandik"
      ],
      "comment": "Dottore: Pantalone, his friend",
      "content": "Feofan Veksel, later Pantalone, was the sole survivor of five subjects in one of Dottore's acute toxicity tests. Dottore supplied experimental drugs and, later, an elixir of immortality that only he could make; the Segments continued the work after Zandik's death. Pantalone funds him and found a remote Snezhnayan village for one of his experiments.",
