      "key": [
        "Setaria",
        "Akasha Terminal",
        "Farrokhzadan",
        "false sky trade"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Dottore",
        "Nahida",
        "Sumeru"
      ],
      "comment": "Dottore: Sumeru and the Gnosis trade",
      "content": "Dottore offered the Akademiya's sages a new God of Wisdom made from Scaramouche, knowing they revered Rukkhadevata and scorned Kusanali. He altered Akasha Terminals to plant thoughts in minds, trapped Nahida's consciousness, hired Eremites, and had children kidnapped to lure the Aranara.",
