      "key": [
        "False Moon",
        "Palestar Edict",
        "Ashveil Peak",
        "Nasha Town",
        "Artificial Moon Marrow"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Dottore",
        "Columbina",
        "Nod-Krai"
      ],
      "comment": "Dottore: The False Moon God of Nod-Krai",
      "content": "After the Kuuvahki Experimental Design Bureau opened, Dottore stayed in Nod-Krai with Sandrone. He took charge of the Palestar Edict, harassed the Frostmoon Scions, secretly collected Rerir's fragments, and pretended to obey Arlecchino's recall request. On Moon-Prayer Night he lured Columbina to a false moon and took both Marrows.",
