      "key": [
        "Irminsul burning",
        "Truth Amongst the Pages of Purana",
        "Aaru",
        "soul split"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Dottore",
        "Nahida",
        "Pantalone"
      ],
      "comment": "Dottore: Death in Irminsul",
      "content": "After the Gnosis trade he planned to split his soul: one half would die and enter the Ley Lines, the other be uploaded as data, and they would recombine in Irminsul. Columbina's moonbeam provided the death, Pantalone the upload.",
